### XxxController 真实接口调用测试
### 使用方式：服务启动后，在 IntelliJ HTTP Client 中直接运行
### 文件放置路径：src/test/java/{package}/controller/http/XxxControllerTest.http

@host = http://localhost:{port}
@contentType = application/json

### 公共请求头（网关透传的用户上下文，本地联调时手动传入）
@userId = 1001
@tenantId = 1
@token = dev-token-for-local-test

# ==================== 新增 ====================

### [TC-01] 正常新增
POST {{host}}/xxx/create
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "测试名称",
  "description": "测试描述"
}

### [TC-02] 参数缺失（name 为空）→ 期望参数校验失败
POST {{host}}/xxx/create
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "description": "缺少 name 字段"
}

# ==================== 查询 ====================

### [TC-03] 根据 ID 查询 → 正常返回
GET {{host}}/xxx/detail?id=1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### [TC-04] 根据 ID 查询 → ID 不存在，期望 NOT_FOUND 错误码
GET {{host}}/xxx/detail?id=99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### [TC-05] 分页列表查询
POST {{host}}/xxx/page
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10,
  "keyword": ""
}

# ==================== 更新 ====================

### [TC-06] 正常更新
POST {{host}}/xxx/update
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "更新后的名称"
}

### [TC-07] 更新不存在的记录 → 期望 NOT_FOUND 错误码
POST {{host}}/xxx/update
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "id": 99999,
  "name": "不存在的记录"
}

# ==================== 删除 ====================

### [TC-08] 正常删除
POST {{host}}/xxx/delete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "id": 1
}
